-- Fixed storage columns remain a record. The function payload has extensible
-- definition keys; nullable sourceRegistryId and native Date timestamps retain
-- their existing host representations as Any, rather than claiming Maybe/String.
@label "Get function by name"
@description "Fetch a single FenelFunction row by name for the current account. Returns Just <row> on hit, Nothing on miss. Wraps @fenel/db:getFunction(accountId, name). Used by the dashboard /functions/:name body."
